{"sourceUrl":"https://www.lzdxdyyy.com/Web/SpecialTopic/Detail/46bebe5a-bbbb-525f-d621-3a2200b00591?rootTypeId=121","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:31.476179+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://www.lzdxdyyy.com/Web/SpecialTopic/Detail/46bebe5a-bbbb-525f-d621-3a2200b00591?rootTypeId=121","html":"<div>\n<p><span><span>为进一步加强兰州大学第一临床医学院与其他高校之间的学术交流与联系，使优秀大学生深入了解我院临床医学学科发展现状与科研前景，兰州大学第一临床医学院拟于</span><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>13</span><span>日-</span><span>16</span><span>日</span><span>举办优秀大学生暑期夏令营</span><span>活动</span><span>。现面向校内外优秀本科生招收夏令营学员。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>本次活动计划招收本科专业为临床医学、检验医学、影像医学、麻醉学等符合我院硕士研究生招生专业要求的优秀在读本科生</span><span>（</span><span>20</span><span>名—</span><span>30</span><span>名）</span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><strong><span>一、申请条件</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span><span>在校期间学习优秀，未受过任何处分，预计</span><span>2027</span><span>届</span><span>按期</span><span>毕业</span><span>并获得学士学位证书</span><span>的优秀本科</span><span>生</span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><strong><span>二、申请流程</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1.报名时间：即日起至</span><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>6</span><span>月</span><span>30</span><span>日；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2</span><span>.</span><span>申请材料：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>①</span><span>《</span><span>兰州大学第一临床医学院</span><span>2026</span><span>年优秀大学生暑期夏令营申请表</span><span>》</span><span>（见附件）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>②</span><span>本科成绩单与本专业排名证明扫描件（需加盖教务处或院系公章）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>③</span><span>外语水平证明，全国大学英语四</span><span>/</span><span>六级成绩单或其他同类别英语考试成绩单扫描件；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>④</span><span>其他证明材料，如已发表论文或专利扫描件、本科期间各类获奖证书扫描件等。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.</span><span>报名方法：申请人将《</span><span>兰<a href=\"https://www.lzdxdyyy.com/Web/SpecialTopic/Detail/46bebe5a-bbbb-525f-d621-3a2200b00591?rootTypeId=121\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a>州大学第一临床医学院</span><span>2026</span><span>年优秀大学生暑期夏令营申请表</span><span>》及相关</span><span>申请</span><span>材料的电子扫描件</span><span>（</span><span>PDF格式，压缩包命名“姓名-本科院校-本科专业-夏令营申请”</span><span>）</span><span>发送至：</span><a href=\"https://www.lzdxdyyy.com/Web/SpecialTopic/Detail/46bebe5a-bbbb-525f-d621-3a2200b00591?rootTypeId=121\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><u><span>ldyyyjszsb@126.com</span></u></a><span> </span><span>，并同时点击链接填报相关信息</span><span>（</span><span>  https://form.wjx.com/vm/OrQZxKJ.aspx#      </span><span>）</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4.资格确定：学院根据申请者提供</span><span>的</span><span>材料择优入选，</span><span>夏令营开营前</span><span>在</span><span>兰州大学第一</span><span>医院</span><span>官方网站（</span><span>https://www.lzdxdyyy.com/</span><span>）公</span><span>布</span><span>最终</span><span>参加夏令营人员名单。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><strong><span>三、夏令营活动安排</span></strong><strong><span>（</span></strong><strong><span>见附件</span></strong><strong><span>）</span></strong><strong><span>   </span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span><strong><span>四、学员待遇</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span>1.学院将为入选营员统一提供免费食宿。</span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.外地学生请自行预定往返车票，学生需保存并在返校后以快递形式提交相关票据</span><span>，</span><span>学院将按照实际票价报销交通费。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3.学院为参营人员购买夏令营活动期间人身意外伤害保险，参与夏令营活动期间发生的医疗费用及因个人行为导致的意外事故，由学员本人或其派出单位承担。</span></p>\n<p><span><strong><span>五</span></strong><strong><span>、其他</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1</span><span>.</span><span>报名学生必须严格遵守学院夏令营的相关管理制度，保证能够按时参加夏令营期间举办的所有活动，否则将不予颁发结业证书并不报销相关费用</span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2</span><span>.所提供报名材料必须真实可靠；发现有弄虚作假等欺骗行为者，取消参加资格。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><strong><span>六</span></strong><strong><span>、联系方式</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span><span>联 系 人：</span><span>甘老师 </span><span>王老师</span><span> </span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>电</span><span>  </span><span>  话：0931-8625163</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>电子邮箱：</span><a href=\"https://www.lzdxdyyy.com/Web/SpecialTopic/Detail/46bebe5a-bbbb-525f-d621-3a2200b00591?rootTypeId=121\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><u><span>ldyyyjszsb@126.com</span></u></a></span></p>\n<p><span><span>地 </span><span>   </span><span>址：甘肃省兰州市城关区东岗西路1号兰州大学第一医院</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>医院官网：http</span><span>s</span><span>:</span><span>//www.lzdxdyyy.com</span></span></p>\n</div>","textSha256":"ffdd5dda552f69fb8d373b1a1ac309c03f000ff028b753494723cb438ff98c63","textLength":1041,"sourceSha256":"57fb76b30459f28aab1f4ee3cd371b2cac39b05ac3cb9ec3cda5183d48dcf400","selector":"#articleContent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-3638deb1a5aee9f699d3","title":"2026年兰州大学第一临床医学院关于举办2026年优秀大学生暑期夏令营活动的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:31.476179+00:00"}
